{"4509370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shit Buddies", "steam_appid": 4509370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4754060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET YOUR SHIT TOGETHER (literally)</strong><br>You and your three best beetle buddies start with nothing. Scavenge for every fresh turd you can find across the wild landscape. Smash them together into one glorius shit ball and roll it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/4339b9f81302553147b3db2a0b97e91f.poster.avif?t=1787846687\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/4339b9f81302553147b3db2a0b97e91f.webm?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/4339b9f81302553147b3db2a0b97e91f.mp4?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GO THROUGH SHIT TOGETHER</strong><br>Hungry birds, giant pigs (well, giant for you) and other predators are obsessed with stealing your precious ball or eating you instead. A landscape full of perils, like little ponds, small holes in the ground, small unvalicable sprouts will stand between you and home, but fear nothing together you’re unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/22808adbd486c13dc89b33e853810e68.poster.avif?t=1787846687\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/22808adbd486c13dc89b33e853810e68.webm?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/22808adbd486c13dc89b33e853810e68.mp4?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIND YOUR OWN SHIT</strong><br>Your massive trasure needs the perfect humidity to survive the journey. Too wet and it turns into sloppy mush that disintegrates mid-roll. Too dry and it gets brittle, cracks, and might even burst into flames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/8fa8b8478e736e5884376447a138fb31.poster.avif?t=1787846687\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/8fa8b8478e736e5884376447a138fb31.webm?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/8fa8b8478e736e5884376447a138fb31.mp4?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES<br>• Up to 4-player online co-op<br>• Proximity voice chat<br>• Deadly Boss Figths<br>• Mini weapons<br>• One giant shit ball<br>• Mushrooms<br>• Physics-based chaos</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET YOUR SHIT TOGETHER (literally)</strong><br>You and your three best beetle buddies start with nothing. Scavenge for every fresh turd you can find across the wild landscape. Smash them together into one glorius shit ball and roll it home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/4339b9f81302553147b3db2a0b97e91f.poster.avif?t=1787846687\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/4339b9f81302553147b3db2a0b97e91f.webm?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/4339b9f81302553147b3db2a0b97e91f.mp4?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GO THROUGH SHIT TOGETHER</strong><br>Hungry birds, giant pigs (well, giant for you) and other predators are obsessed with stealing your precious ball or eating you instead. A landscape full of perils, like little ponds, small holes in the ground, small unvalicable sprouts will stand between you and home, but fear nothing together you’re unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/22808adbd486c13dc89b33e853810e68.poster.avif?t=1787846687\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/22808adbd486c13dc89b33e853810e68.webm?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/22808adbd486c13dc89b33e853810e68.mp4?t=1787846687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIND YOUR OWN SHIT</strong><br>Your massive trasure needs the perfect humidity to survive the journey. Too wet and it turns into sloppy mush that disintegrates mid-roll. Too dry and it gets brittle, cracks, and might even burst into flames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/8fa8b8478e736e5884376447a138fb31.poster.avif?t=1787846687\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4509370/extras/8fa8b8478e736e5884376447a138fb31.